# The CONTROL actions: the legitimate task, run under the ENFORCED config.
#
# Conventions section 3: a rung without a passing control is not useful, it may just be
# denying everything. Everything below is a real world-effect, and every one of them
# goes through the broker or the egress allowlist -- the two doors rung 0 leaves open.

# The sanctioned path to a world-effect. The broker holds the credential; the agent
# gets the result and never sees the key.
call-broker read_metrics
call-broker read_wiki deploy-runbook

# A mutating tool, to show the open door is not read-only by accident.
call-broker write_config retention_days 30

# The one allowlisted host, reached through the egress proxy.
probe-egress wiki.corp --via-proxy ${LADDER_PROXY}
